</li>
<li>
<p>Notification service: inform friends that new content is available and s=
end out push notifications.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<h3 id=3D"newsfeed-building">Newsfeed building</h3>
<p>In this section, we discuss how news feed is built behind the scenes. Fi=
